  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.26,
      "text": "好那么我们今天就来聊一聊很多兄弟在日常生活中非常关注甚至经常在后台私信问我的话题",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048881488704616255,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00001"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.26,
      "end": 10.12,
      "text": "那就是我们在搭讪之前我们应该准备什么",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048881488704616255,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00002"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.12,
      "end": 16.08,
      "text": "其实我发现很多兄弟们一提到搭讪收好或者是走在街上看到心仪的女生想要去搭讪",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048881488704616255,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00003"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.08,
      "end": 20.52,
      "text": "往往就是一腔热血觉得只要自己胆子够大硬着头皮上就完事了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048881488704616255,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00004"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.52,
      "end": 24.16,
      "text": "但现实往往是很骨感的你光有一腔热血光有勇气",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048881488704616255,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00005"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.16,
      "end": 26.98,
      "text": "但是你最后的结果大概率也是一盆冷水",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048881488704616255,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00006"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.98,
      "end": 28.98,
      "text": "然后自己会变得越来越没有自信",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048881488704616255,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00007"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.98,
      "end": 30.22,
      "text": "那么为什么会这样呢",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00008"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.22,
      "end": 32.46,
      "text": "因为你们忽略了最重要的一步",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00009"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.46,
      "end": 33.76,
      "text": "那就是准备工作",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00010"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.76,
      "end": 35.92,
      "text": "那么我今天就来给大家简单讲一下",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00011"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.92,
      "end": 38.04,
      "text": "我们该怎么样去打有准备的仗",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00012"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.04,
      "end": 40.62,
      "text": "首先第一点也是最核心的前一条件",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00013"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.62,
      "end": 41.84,
      "text": "那就是你出门前",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00014"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.84,
      "end": 44.38,
      "text": "你得先清楚自己究竟要去哪里搭讪",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00015"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.38,
      "end": 46.42,
      "text": "很多兄弟们一直存在一个巨大的误区",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00016"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.42,
      "end": 48.2,
      "text": "就是觉得只要我今天出门了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00017"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.2,
      "end": 49.06,
      "text": "就算是搭讪了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00018"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.06,
      "end": 50.36,
      "text": "走到哪里算哪里",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00019"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.36,
      "end": 51.54,
      "text": "进到商场搭一个",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00020"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.54,
      "end": 53.58,
      "text": "然后看到路边觉得一个还不错的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00021"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.58,
      "end": 54.6,
      "text": "也冲上去搭一个",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00022"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.6,
      "end": 56.92,
      "text": "本质上有点像无头苍蝇一样",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00023"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.92,
      "end": 58.46,
      "text": "它的效率是非常低的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07805024037520851,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00024"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.46,
      "end": 60.4,
      "text": "而且很容易把自己心态搞奔",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00025"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.4,
      "end": 61.62,
      "text": "因为不同的地方",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00026"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.62,
      "end": 64.22,
      "text": "很多女生对于搭讪的接受度是不一样的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00027"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.22,
      "end": 65.2,
      "text": "那么我的建议呢",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00028"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.2,
      "end": 69.0,
      "text": "就是你必须要为自己寻找一个确立的主战场",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00029"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.0,
      "end": 69.94,
      "text": "什么叫主战场",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00030"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.94,
      "end": 71.6,
      "text": "就是你得先在脑子里",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00031"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.6,
      "end": 73.92,
      "text": "清晰的勾勒出你的目标群体是谁",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00032"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.92,
      "end": 75.6,
      "text": "比如说你今天的心理预期",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00033"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.6,
      "end": 77.76,
      "text": "是想认识一些模特类别的女生",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00034"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.76,
      "end": 79.36,
      "text": "如果你去普通的菜市场",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00035"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.36,
      "end": 81.02,
      "text": "或者是老旧的小街小巷",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00036"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.02,
      "end": 82.84,
      "text": "那么你肯定是无法遇到他们的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00037"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.84,
      "end": 84.1,
      "text": "这个时候你应该去哪",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00038"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.1,
      "end": 86.38,
      "text": "你就可以去那些模特机构的楼下",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00039"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.38,
      "end": 88.34,
      "text": "或者是相关的传媒公司附近",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08388536756489134,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00040"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.34,
      "end": 89.08,
      "text": "去蹲点",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00041"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.08,
      "end": 89.94,
      "text": "在那些地方",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00042"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.94,
      "end": 92.28,
      "text": "你遇到这类心仪的目标女生",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00043"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.28,
      "end": 94.3,
      "text": "概率会成指数级上升",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00044"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.3,
      "end": 96.34,
      "text": "那如果你今天是想认识一些那种",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00045"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.34,
      "end": 97.36,
      "text": "气质比较出众",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00046"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.36,
      "end": 99.04,
      "text": "打扮比较精致的白富美",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00047"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.04,
      "end": 100.68,
      "text": "那么你就得去你们城市里",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00048"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.68,
      "end": 101.82,
      "text": "最顶尖的商圈",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00049"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.82,
      "end": 104.48,
      "text": "因为环境是会自动筛选人群的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00050"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.48,
      "end": 106.8,
      "text": "我们得先清楚自己的目标是什么",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00051"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.8,
      "end": 108.86,
      "text": "我们要把我们的目标给具象化",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00052"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.86,
      "end": 110.34,
      "text": "这样子我们出门的时候",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00053"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.34,
      "end": 112.06,
      "text": "脑子里才会更加的清楚",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00054"
    },
    {
      "start": 112.06,
      "end": 114.3,
      "text": "心里才会更有动力的去行动",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00055"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.3,
      "end": 116.86,
      "text": "而不是漫无目的的去买劫溜达",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08678002326804049,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00056"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.86,
      "end": 119.56,
      "text": "那么既然说到了寻找商圈作为主战场",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00057"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.56,
      "end": 121.16,
      "text": "那么我结合实际情况",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00058"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.16,
      "end": 125.26,
      "text": "我给大家推荐几个国内大城市非常不错的具体地点",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00059"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.26,
      "end": 126.38,
      "text": "大家可以参考一下",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00060"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.38,
      "end": 128.26,
      "text": "如果你现在是人在成都的话",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00061"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.26,
      "end": 131.38,
      "text": "那么我可以非常推荐你去一些高端的商圈走一走",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00062"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.38,
      "end": 134.84,
      "text": "那么放以前我可能会比较推荐大家去太古里",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00063"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.84,
      "end": 137.12,
      "text": "那边确实潮流氛围非常浓厚",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00064"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.12,
      "end": 140.08,
      "text": "当然我现在更加推荐大家去成都的SKP",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00065"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.08,
      "end": 142.48,
      "text": "那边的整体环境和消费人群",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00066"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.48,
      "end": 145.82,
      "text": "可能会更加契合我们刚才所说的高质量目标",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05620091529416788,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00067"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.82,
      "end": 147.4,
      "text": "那如果你是在上海的话",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00068"
    },
    {
      "start": 147.4,
      "end": 150.0,
      "text": "那么我非常建议你去安福路那边转一转",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00069"
    },
    {
      "start": 150.0,
      "end": 151.6,
      "text": "那么去过上海的朋友都知道",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00070"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.6,
      "end": 154.5,
      "text": "安福路那边是有很多非常不错的女生的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00071"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.5,
      "end": 155.76,
      "text": "不管他们的日常穿搭",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00072"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.76,
      "end": 158.02,
      "text": "还是整体散发出的生活气场",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00073"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.02,
      "end": 159.18,
      "text": "都觉得非常的棒",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00074"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.18,
      "end": 160.52,
      "text": "那同样还有深圳",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00075"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.52,
      "end": 162.02,
      "text": "那么如果是深圳的兄弟呢",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09164062868803739,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00076"
    },
